    "note": "Where each digest below came from, because a digest without that is a claim about one machine rather than about the artifact.",
    "kinds": {
      "localCopy": "Computed from a copy the author holds, on the date given. The weakest provenance this project accepts, and the one every entry currently has. It says the file on one disk hashes to this, and nothing about whether that file is the right one.",
